<Base title="Privacy Policy | SCAR" description="Privacy policy for scar4ever.com — what information is collected and how it is used." page="privacy">
<!-- PRIVACY POLICY — DRAFT -->
<section class="legal" aria-labelledby="legal-title">
  <p class="legal__draft"><span class="confirm">DRAFT</span> This wording is a starting point prepared by Think First Studios. SCAR to review, edit and have checked before launch. It is not legal advice.</p>
  <h1 class="display misreg" id="legal-title" data-text="PRIVACY POLICY">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
  <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: <span class="confirm">[DATE AT LAUNCH]</span></p>
  <div class="legal__body">
    <p>This policy explains what happens to your information when you use scar4ever.com or book with me. “I”, “me” and “SCAR” mean Stephanie Cardona, trading as SCAR, based in Los Angeles, California.</p>

    <h2>What I collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>When you contact me:</b> your name, email address, the service you are interested in, and whatever you write in your message.</li>
      <li><b>When you book:</b> the details needed to run the booking — dates, session type, and anything you tell me about the shoot. <span class="confirm">[REVIEW] booking tool in use</span></li>
      <li><b>When you pay:</b> payments are handled by <span class="confirm">[REVIEW] Stripe</span>. They receive your card details directly. I only see that a payment succeeded, plus the name, email and amount.</li>
      <li><b>Site usage:</b> this site does not use analytics, advertising pixels or tracking cookies of its own. My web host keeps standard server logs, which include IP addresses, so the site stays secure and online.</li>
      <li><b>Photos and video:</b> images from your session, which are personal information as well as creative work.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What I do with it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reply to your enquiry and plan your session or project.</li>
      <li>Take payment, send invoices and keep business records.</li>
      <li>Deliver your files and provide support afterwards.</li>
      <li>Show finished work in my portfolio and on social media, unless you have asked me not to.</li>
      <li>I do <b>not</b> sell or rent your personal information.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who else is involved</h2>
    <p>Some trusted services help run this business and may handle your information on my behalf:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Payment processing: <span class="confirm">[REVIEW] Stripe</span></li>
      <li>Booking and contracts: <span class="confirm">[REVIEW] tool once chosen</span></li>
      <li>Email: Google (Gmail)</li>
      <li>Website hosting and contact form: Netlify. Messages sent through the contact form are stored with them and emailed to me.</li>
      <li>Embedded content: Instagram and YouTube may set their own cookies and see your IP address when their content loads on a page. Image hosting is handled by Sanity, and fonts are loaded from Google Fonts.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
    <p>Enquiries and booking records are kept while we are working together and for <span class="confirm">[REVIEW] how long — e.g. 3 years</span> afterwards, or longer where tax rules require it. Finished photo and video files are kept in my archive unless you ask me to delete them.</p>

    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Ask me what information I hold about you, ask for a copy, or ask me to correct or delete it.</li>
      <li>Ask me not to use your photos publicly, at any time.</li>
      <li>If you are in California, the CCPA gives you the rights above and the right not to be treated differently for using them. I do not sell personal information.</li>
      <li>To make any request, email <a href="mailto:contact.scarmosttdope@gmail.com">contact.scarmosttdope@gmail.com</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The site itself sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising trackers. Embedded Instagram and YouTube content may set their own cookies when it loads, and Google Fonts and my host will see your IP address as part of delivering the page.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not aimed at children under 13 and I do not knowingly collect their information. Sessions involving anyone under 18 are booked by a parent or guardian.</p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>I take reasonable steps to keep your information safe, but no website or email is completely secure. Please do not send sensitive details such as card numbers by email.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the new version will appear on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:contact.scarmosttdope@gmail.com">contact.scarmosttdope@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
